# SingleStepTests/z80 JSON fixtures: downloaded on demand by
# SingleStepTestLoader, not vendored (see CLAUDE.md §7a).
tests/Z80.Tests/SingleStepTests/data/

# Local asset library: ROMs, cartridge images, tapes and disk images. Personal/collected
# material that does not belong in the repo, and much of it is large.
#
# NOTE: this does NOT untrack the fixtures already committed here — the test suite depends on
# several of them (assets/BASIC.bin, assets/Basic-24.bin, assets/P2000ROM.rom, and the disk
# images under assets/Disks/ used by the boot/disk tests). Ignore rules only affect UNtracked
# files, so those stay versioned and keep working.
#
# Consequence to remember: a genuinely new test fixture added under assets/ will be silently
# ignored. Commit one with `git add -f assets/<file>`.
assets/
